  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 4th level, after spending at least 1 minute with her vitae pool at 0, the crimson dancer gains a +10-foot enhancement bonus to her base land speed, and her next attack that applies bloodletting to a creature that was not bleeding deals an additional 1d6 points of damage. At 12th level and every 8 levels thereafter, these bonuses increase by +10 feet and +1d6 respectively. These bonuses are lost after the crimson dancer gains any amount of vitae.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/crimson-dancer#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
